`,s.jsx(i.p,{children:"The second app is called Lemonade. In this simple app, the user clicks the image button to traverse through the stages of making a lemonade. The first screen is a lemon tree that, once clicked, takes you to the next screen with a lemon. In this second screen the user must click the lemon a random number of times to proceed to the next screen. In the third screen, the glass of lemonade can be clicked to “drink” it and move on to the fourth screen. Lastly, the user can click the empty glass to return back to the first screen and restart the process."}),`
